Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.64,Hdr,,0,0,0,,June 1, 2025 - Japanese Derby
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Fuchu's long straight - the Derby reaches its climax
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:06.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Front-runner Hoo Ou Art Man - his lead is disappearing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:08.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Satono Shining moves to catch him on the outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:12.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,But outside him, Croix du Nord already leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:14.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Revenge for the Satsuki Sho? The jockey's whip is flying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:17.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Satono Shining is hanging on along the inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:18.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then Shohei is closing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:21.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,To the top of the generation - Croix du Nord leads
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:24.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Masquerade Ball closing from the outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:28.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Masquerade Ball closing - but Croix du Nord in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Croix du Nord wins it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:34.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's Croix du Nord
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:38.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Jockey Yuichi Kitamura wins his long-awaited first Derby!